<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/13/eng@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting, after Part III, the following Part: PART IIIA INVESTMENT BY MEMBER OF THE FUND 29A. (1) Notwithstanding anything contrary to the provisions of this Act, the Board may, subject to any regulations and rules made under this Act, authorize an application for investment, made by a member of the Fund, partly any amount standing to the credit of such member of the Fund in fund management institutions approved by the Minister, subject to such terms and conditions as he thinks fit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/13/eng@> .
