<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/13/eng@/~sched_7__para_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Scope of corporation. Nothing in this Act shall be construed to authorize the Board to establish any corporation for any purpose or object more extensive in scope than the purposes or objects for which the Board was constituted or as conferring on any corporation any right, duty, power or function which is not within the rights, duties, powers or functions of the Board under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/13/eng@> .
